<title>INDIA: ANZ Grindlays cuts Indian prime rate to 15.5 pct.</title>
<headline>ANZ Grindlays cuts Indian prime rate to 15.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Grindlays Plc reduced its Indian prime lending rate to 15.5 percent per annum from 16.0 percent effective from July 1, a company official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The spread remains unchanged at 4.0 percent, he said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
